        "text_Gp9EqL": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": true,
            "text": "<p>At<a href=\"https://www.rebelnell.com/pages/our-mission\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.rebelnell.com/pages/our-mission\"> <strong>Rebel Nell</strong></a>, we believe in turning barriers into opportunities. Named after trailblazer <a href=\"https://www.rebelnell.com/pages/our-story\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.rebelnell.com/pages/our-story\"><strong>Eleanor Roosevelt</strong></a>, we empower women facing barriers to employment by providing equitable opportunities, wraparound support, and a pathway to self-sufficiency.</p><p>We repurpose Detroit’s fallen graffiti and meaningful materials into <strong>One Of No Other Kind</strong> jewelry and accessories, ensuring that each piece is as unique as the woman who made it. More than art, every piece carries <strong>a </strong>piece of Detroit histor<strong>y</strong>—a testament to resilience, creativity, and community.</p><p>When you wear Rebel Nell, you’re not just making a statement—you’re making a difference.</p>"
          }
